      "caption": null,
      "body": "বা, $\\frac{a^{x-2}}{a^{1-x}} = \\frac{2^{x-3} \\cdot 2^1}{2^{3x-5}}$ বা, $a^{x-2-1+x} = 2^{x-3+1-3x+5}$",
